WEBVTT

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:11.400
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.740
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.370
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.460
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.680
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.350
by ridding you...

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:43.520
...of your other love?

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:48.110
At sunset,

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.650
when the children go home,

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:54.570
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.450
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.540
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.390
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.890
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:35.280
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:38.280
My Aoki award-winning Mama.
The chipmunk on her head is Maro-chan.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:41.280
My chauffeur, manager,
and ex-pimp, Rei-kun.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:42.620
The mysterious white bat straight man.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:44.290
I'm Babbit.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:47.960
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy
and good friend, I suppose.

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:50.290
Mitsuya-sensei and Tanaka-sensei.

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:52.960
A love-love couple who are
very close to each other.

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:57.630
"Love Tastes Like Curry"

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:01.390
--"The Funny Teachers
at Our School" Corner!

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:04.060
Okay, thank you for your lettuhs!

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:06.600
Our lettuh this time is from a school

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:10.060
where they have a very close couple
that are hot for each othuh!

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:11.400
What kind of couple?

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:15.400
They're teachuhs who are...
getting it on with each othuh.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.400
"Our teachers are
ones who are about to get married,

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:20.070
and stick all over each other,
even in front of the students."

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:21.410
That's what they write!

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:24.410
Aah! How embarrassing for the school!

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:28.080
Well, next week, we're gonna go visit
your school, Sasaki Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.080
Be expecting us!

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:31.670
Okay!

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.340
You mean, that's Tsuyoshi-kun,
from my school?

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:36.340
Oh, no doubt about it.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.680
What, you mean that's
your school, Sana-chan?

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:42.680
The one where the boys and the goils
are on hostile toims with each othuh?

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.680
That was a long time ago!

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:46.680
Right now, we even have teachers
making it with each other,

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:49.020
and it's the very picture
of friendship and peace.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:52.020
By all means, come visit us.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.690
"Or so she says..."

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:56.030
What's happening?

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.360
You guys didn't clean up,
so get on out of here!

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:01.700
--Yeah!

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.370
Is this only your classroom!?

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.370
Sana-chan... Sana-chan...

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:07.700
What happened?

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.460
Get down, it's dangerous there!

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:11.370
Things have gone back
to the way they were before.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:12.380
That's not good.

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:14.710
Tsuyoshi-kun, you sent a postcard
to "Child's Toy," right?

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.050
Huh? How did you know?

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:17.710
Because it was read.

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:20.720
You mean, my name is going to
be heard all over the country?

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:24.390
On top of that, "Child's Toy" is
coming to visit our school next week.

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:25.720
And yet...

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:28.390
...what is the meaning of this!?

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:29.390
Ooh, this bloodlust is incredible...

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.690
What are you doing, Sana-chan!?

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:33.350
Don't tell me you're going
to take the boys' side!

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:36.320
Tsuyoshi, what do you think you're doing,
taking the girls' side!?

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.990
I was just telling Sana-chan
what the current situation is.

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.990
I don't know whose fault it is.

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:42.360
The current situation?

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:43.660
Whose fault it is?

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.030
Tsuyoshi-kun, a moment...

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:47.030
What on earth happened?

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:47.990
A- as it happens...

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.000
Do it normally!

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.000
...something terrible happened
yesterday at cleaning time!

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.040
What? What? What?

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:57.710
Gomi-kun started arguing
with Hisae-chan and the others.

00:03:57.710 --> 00:04:01.340
Then Mitsuya-sensei came in
and gave them a warning.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.050
That's when the problem started.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:06.050
What's going on? Are you goldbricking
on cleaning again, Gomi-kun?

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:09.720
Well...you know...

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:13.390
Yeah, sure. I can understand
how you don't like to clean.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:16.190
Tanaka-sensei,
you shouldn't be saying that.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:18.360
It's their turn to do it,
so they need to do it properly.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.730
It would be wrong not to do it.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:23.400
Yeah, but after we do it,
these guys complain about it. Right?

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:24.070
--Yeah!

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:26.320
"Did you clean this?
It's positively filthy!

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.740
Gomi-kun, you really do
like gomi ("trash"), huh?"

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.450
Oh, I can understand that!
It never fails.

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:32.000
Even when you do it right,
you get snapped at.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.330
Am I right, Mitsuya-sensei?

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:36.330
But they aren't doing it right.
They're barely doing it at all.

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:37.670
That's not true!

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:39.000
--You're not doing it!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.670
But boys aren't very good
when it comes to cleaning...

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:43.340
That's right, Sensei! That's right!

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:46.010
What do you mean by that?

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:48.680
Is that what you think, Norio-san?

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.220
Were you lying when

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:52.020
you said we'd do the cleaning and laundry
together once we got married?

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.350
No, I wouldn't say I was lying...

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:57.020
You were going to say you weren't any
good at it, and push it all on me, huh?

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:59.360
But Mitsuya-sensei,
you're so good at cleaning...

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:02.030
That's right. People who are good
at it should be the ones who do it.

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:03.690
Yeah. I like what you're saying, Gomi.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:07.030
Nonetheless, you sure take good care of
that crazy five-storied pagoda of yours.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:08.370
Five-storied pagoda?

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:10.370
Not this again...

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:12.040
That five-story pagoda...

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:13.370
...is my heart and soul!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:15.370
It just has "Heart and Soul"
written on it, right?

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.370
They mean this.

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.380
Hey, you can't talk to me like that!

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:19.380
"Hey"?

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:21.710
Did you just say "hey" to me?

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:25.720
Yeah, I said it! I'm the kind of man
who says "hey" to his wife!

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:28.010
Ha! You sure are old-fashioned
and hardheaded!

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:30.720
--Your way of thinking is outdated! Right?
--Old-fashioned! Low-grade!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:33.980
And I'm not doing my hair up!

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:37.310
Doing your hair up and wearing a
wedding kimono is a Japanese tradition!

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:38.650
Like this!

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.980
I'm not wearing that!
I want a wedding dress!

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.650
You're so stubborn!

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.990
Hardhead! Anyhow,
the girls are not cleaning!

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.320
--That's right! We're not!

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.320
Fine! The boys aren't doing it, either!

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.990
Yeah, why should we!?

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:52.330
Doesn't it somehow seem that
this problem has doubled?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:55.660
So, Hisae-chan and Gomi-kun called out
to the others, and ultimately...

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.330
It turned into this, did it?

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:01.000
Tanaka-sensei is the worst!
Why does he have to be so high-handed?

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.340
How so?

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:05.340
Oh, are you here, Hayama?
Does it bother you?

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.340
Not really.

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:07.680
I've got this!

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.010
The personality assessment notebook!

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:11.010
According to this, if you marry a man

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:13.010
who treasures his heart-and-soul
five-story pagoda,

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.020
nothing good will come of it.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.020
So?

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.480
So, it means that Mitsuya-sensei is right

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:19.480
--when she says you should clean up
for yourself, doesn't it!?
--Shut up.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:21.690
--when she says you should clean up
for yourself, doesn't it!?
--she's still talking to you.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:24.690
Ah, come to think of it, I've never
seen you do any proper cleaning, Hayama!

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.360
Hey! Hayama!

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:29.030
"Shut up"?! Did you just
say "shut up" to me!?

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:30.360
Didn't you hear me?

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:31.320
I dare you to say it again!

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:31.990
Shut up.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:33.330
Screech!

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.330
That does it, that does it,
that does it!

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.000
What are you, a cow?

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.330
--That does it! Now I'm furious!
--Kurata-san!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:43.340
Sensei! I just heard the whole situation!

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:44.340
Sana-chan...

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.670
Everyone, I'm taking
Mitsuya-sensei's side!

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:50.220
Once you get married,
let the husband clean, and do laundry,

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.010
and cook three times a day!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.350
There goes Kurata Sana!

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:56.350
What was that? Don't go talking
it up the way you want it!

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.680
What? What? What?
You've got a problem with that?

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:01.350
If you've got something to say,
then ba-ba-ba-bing, say it!

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:03.560
You won't say it? If you won't say it,
then how about I say it for you?

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:04.360
Come on, don't cry, speak up!

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:08.030
--We can't beat her with words.
--You guys are always
making so much trouble-

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:09.030
Hayama-san!

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.700
You came back!

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.700
Hayama! Is that what you mean!?

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.370
It doesn't matter either way, does it?

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:19.040
Either way? It doesn't
matter either way!?

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:25.880
Sana-chan has snapped!

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.970
You boys stay dirty, and don't clean up!

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:32.970
What!?

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.850
I declare an all-out battle with the boys!

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:38.980
Kurata Sana, on behalf of
the girls of 6th Year, 3rd Class!

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:41.980
Girls, let's hang tough!

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.980
Somebody come forward
and represent the boys!

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:45.980
--Hayama-san-
--Oh, me?

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.650
On behalf of the boys, Gomi!

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:48.650
And Kojima!

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.320
And ltami!

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:56.330
This is terrible. If this keeps up,

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:59.660
I'll be kept away from Aya-chan forever!

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:03.000
There was a lot I wanted to
talk to Aya-chan about today.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:04.670
Ah, Aya-chan noticed me...

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:07.000
--Sana-chan, your face
is getting in the way!
--Aya-chan!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.340
Can't we talk to each other, Aya-chan?

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:13.010
What will these two's destiny be?

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:15.010
Okay, Sensei, let's get class started.

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:16.010
But the boys-

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:17.680
I think we can leave the boys alone.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:20.680
No class for the boys!

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:22.690
We can't have that!

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:24.020
I heard everything!

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.350
Where did you hear it from?

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:28.020
Mitsuya-sensei, what is
the meaning of this?

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:31.650
Are you still bent out of shape
about what happened earlier?

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.610
Will the gentleman who
is hardheaded about me

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:34.950
wearing my hair up please remain quiet.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:37.320
The traditional hairstyle
is the man's romantic ideal!

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.290
I told you, I want to wear a dress!

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:42.620
Very well! As long as we don't
see eye-to-eye, then as a guy,

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:45.620
I will teach the guys!

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:47.330
Be my guest!

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:50.300
Guys, class is starting!

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.300
Girls, we're starting, too!

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:54.970
Come on, let's go!

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:57.640
Aya-chan, let's all fight together!

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.010
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:00.680
Aya-chan...

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:01.680
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:04.350
Aya-chan...

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.560
"The classroom is split in half"

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:08.020
Okay then, girls, as girls...

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.320
And guys, as guys...

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:12.320
--...class is starting!
--...class is starting!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:15.360
First period is Social Studies, right?
How far have we gotten?

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:16.660
--The Kamakura Shogunate!

00:09:16.660 --> 00:09:17.660
That's right! The Kamakura Shogunate!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:18.660
Do it normally, already!

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.030
She's all fired up!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:21.700
Sensei, things are looking up.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:24.370
I didn't think he had such issues!

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.670
You mean, Tanaka-sensei has "ish" shoes?

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:28.040
I've never seen him wear
anything but sandals.

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:30.040
Those aren't the kind
of "shoes" she means!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:31.960
Will you please stop
badmouthing others!?

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:36.300
Another thing that's weird is the way
he cries as he plays the harmonica.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:38.970
Guys, your first period
will be Harmonica Class!

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.300
Sensei, it's Social Studies...

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.970
What's wrong with the harmonica!?

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:45.350
The timbre that makes
one long for home!

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:50.860
Everyone else, start playing too!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.320
Such a heartrending timbre!

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.660
You really are weird!

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.990
Aya-chan, what are you doing right now?

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:04.330
There's a great wall of the sexes
between us, huh?

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.290
"Wall of the Sexes"

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:07.330
Just how long will it take
before this wall is gone?

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:12.340
Will that day soon come?
That day... that day!

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:15.010
Sasaki! Stop spacing off!

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:15.670
Right!

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:18.340
The Kamakura Shogunate
was established in 1192.

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:21.010
Keep it down!

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.350
What a jerk!

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:25.680
Sensei, we won't be beat!
Let's use my Norinori!

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.520
"Sana-chan and the others sing"

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.480
I think harmonicas are nice, too.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:29.690
♪ Build a great nation,
Kamakura Shogunate! ♪

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:30.600
--♪ Build a great nation, ♪

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:31.610
--♪ Kamakura Shogunate! ♪

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:33.610
♪ And let the boys do the cleaning! ♪

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.940
--♪ And let the boys do the cleaning! ♪

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:37.950
The boys aren't going to do the cleaning!

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:38.950
--The boys aren't going

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:39.950
--to do the cleaning!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:42.620
Traditional... traditional hairstyle!

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:43.280
Back off!

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:44.290
--Let the boys do it!

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:45.620
--The boys aren't doing it!

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:46.950
Ooh, listen to that!

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:48.960
I can't take this.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:51.630
What is 3rd Class doing here!?

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:53.630
Just what you see here. Any questions?

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:54.960
Any questions!?

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:57.300
You're being too loud in here like this!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.630
It's still better than your
grating voice, you wrinkled hag.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.300
Wrinkled- wrinkled hag?

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:02.970
Makeup!

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:06.970
This is an alarming situation!
I'm reporting you to the principal!

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:10.310
Go ahead, feel free! This is
the girls' fault, after all!

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:12.650
Andoh-sensei, please don't be fooled!

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:15.650
This is the boys' fault!
Everyone, call Andoh-sensei over!

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:17.990
--Let's limbo!!

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:20.240
Limbo!

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:21.990
Clear!

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:23.320
Andoh-sensei!

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:25.780
I won't hear of it! I'm going
to report those of you over here

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:28.000
to the principal, too, understand?

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.330
Ah, she's snapped!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:34.000
Go ahead! Andoh-sensei, you're so angry
all the time, it gives you more wrinkles!

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:35.340
Makeup!

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.340
Way to go, Mitsuya-sensei!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:40.340
Alarming... this is beyond alarming!

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.340
Principal!!

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:44.010
Don't run in the hall!

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.640
Sensei, you can't let the boys
get off easy on this.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:48.020
They'll just take
advantage of it right away.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.020
After you get married, you'll be
the one left crying, Mitsuya-sensei.

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:52.020
You're right! It's all-out resistance!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:58.900
"All-out resistance"

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:56.360
In other words, fighting to
the very end. You see? Okay.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.900
Okay, Baby's Rock!

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:04.700
When can I see you again, Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:08.700
Aya-chan, I'll make sure I come see you,

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.870
and overcome this wall.

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:17.170
You work it out with "guts"!

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:26.010
"Enter Narunaru"

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:28.140
Principal, hurry, hurry!

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:30.470
We mustn't run in the halls.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:32.770
Are you sure you should be doing that?

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.770
Ordinarily, it would be wrong.

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:36.110
In any case...

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:38.110
--It's the boys' fault!

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:39.440
So you see...

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:41.440
--It's the girls' fault!

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:45.610
I declare! To split the room in half and
hold class like this is unprecedented,

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:48.450
right Principal?

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:53.460
This is indeed an alarming situation!

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:56.420
Principal, what is your decision?

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:04.130
It'll be fine-fine...
It'll be fine-fine...

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:06.140
I knew he would say that.

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:08.470
This day is dragging
on along time, huh?

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:11.810
We got the principal's okay!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:14.140
--Boys! Boys! Boys!

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:18.860
Ah! Will I never be able to see
Aya-chan again for the rest of my life?

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:22.820
Aya-chan!

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:25.490
You're doing fine, huh?

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:27.160
All right, I can't let
this beat me, either!

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.490
I won't be beaten!

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:30.830
That's it, Sasaki! That's the spirit!

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:32.620
"School lunch time"

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:35.410
Kurata! Don't run in the hall!

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:38.920
That goes for you, too! Ah, Kojima-kun,
you're not wearing any underpants!

00:13:40.090 --> 00:13:42.090
Thank goodness, I am wearing them.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:44.420
Kurata, you tricked me!

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:45.420
Zing!

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:49.760
And so, for today's lunch, we're having
the roux sauce for curry rice!

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:53.100
The boys took the rice away on us,
but come on, rice by itself?

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:54.770
The girls win this one!

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:56.100
Well done, Kojima!

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:58.100
Nothing beats rice for us
Japanese boys, right?

00:13:58.100 --> 00:14:01.440
The boys have as good
as won this round!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.110
Tsuyoshi-kun isn't here...

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:04.530
"The two of them walk a thorny path"

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:08.110
This certainly is a thorny path. Ow!

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:10.120
Aya-chan? Aya-chan?

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.450
Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:13.450
Over here, over here!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:18.120
Wow, thanks, Aya-chan!

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:20.790
Don't tell anyone.

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:23.460
--"We humbly accept!" Delicious!
--"We humbly accept!" Delicious!

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.130
Let's be the only ones
who aren't fighting, okay?

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:27.130
Mm-hmm!

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:30.140
Oh, and right about there,
I say nice going, Tsuyoshi!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:32.390
Just the curry by itself is like
having stew, and it's yummy, huh?

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:33.390
--Yummy!

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:35.060
Just rice by itself isn't so great.

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:37.730
Is this what it's going
to be like every day?

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:38.730
"Thanks for the meal."

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:40.400
"Thanks for the meal!"

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.110
Tsuyoshi, you sure seem happy.

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.440
I like rice, after all.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:46.440
Ah, you've got curry on
the corner of your mouth!

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:47.440
What!?

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:48.450
Where?

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.110
Huh? Must have imagined it...

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:52.120
"The battle continues"

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:55.080
"Us girls will win! Home Ec Special Class
Special Lecture: Arranging your Furniture"

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:55.080
The girls are getting a special lesson in Home Economics?

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:56.450
Wow, how cute!

00:14:56.450 --> 00:15:01.420
See? Isn't it cute? It's my dream to
live in a European-style house like this.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.460
That's the dream of any girl.

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:08.470
Today, let's think of the
ideal way to place everything.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:09.760
And the boys?

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.760
"Boys are sure to win. Lesson:
Learning the Spirit of Japan"

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:12.800
A class on learning the spirit of Japan?

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:13.800
No fooling around!

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:15.100
Pfft! Calligraphy.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:18.180
Japanese men live in houses
with tatami mats!

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:21.440
Everyone, let's study
the spirit of Japan!

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:24.480
I'm not very good
at calligraphy, though.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:26.860
Ah, I goofed up.

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.780
The boys' garbage is coming this way!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.740
Hey, boys! Don't throw
your garbage away over here!

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:34.070
Now what is it?

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.080
Your garbage came over here!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:36.740
Garbage?

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:37.740
This!

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:41.080
"Japan"

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:41.080
Will you boys please
throw away your own garbage?

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:43.750
Are you calling the
spirit of Japan garbage!?

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:46.090
--It's the boys' fault!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.090
--What did you say!?

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:50.090
Show these girls the spirit of Japan!

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:52.760
How could they!?

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:53.760
What do we do?

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.890
Let me handle this!

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.770
Kurata is starting up!

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:07.860
"The tragedy continues on forever"

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:07.900
After school...

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:13.780
Hayama! Clean up before you go!

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:15.780
--Hayama-san!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:18.370
--Hey, boys!

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.790
This week's Sana-chan.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:26.790
Why do boys hate to clean?
That I do not know.

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:29.800
But the girls' view is right on this,
isn't it?

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:32.380
Humans are animals that
like to fight by nature.

00:16:32.380 --> 00:16:37.050
We don't like to fight! This is
all because the boys are wrong!

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:41.730
We know that it's wrong to wage war,
but just take a look at human history.

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:44.730
They repeat themselves over
and over again, don't they?

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:48.860
Forcing your views on others, and the
pleasure taken in holding them down-

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:50.730
that's what we cannot give up.

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.400
Am I wrong?

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:56.410
That's not it, I tell you.
What do you think I should do?

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:58.080
Maro-chan!

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.030
"Advice ¥10"

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.080
You're charging me money!?

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:01.080
If you don't like it,
go somewhere else!

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:02.410
Here!

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:10.420
When you can sincerely think of others,
and attain a state of selflessness,

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:16.430
the answer will naturally present itself.

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:18.430
Give me my money back.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:21.770
You think I can become that
sort of sage-like person?

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.770
Your mother will!

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.770
Whatever your failures,
or your mistakes,

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:29.440
I will always hold you
in my arms with motherly love.

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:34.280
No matter how dirty you leave your room,
or how little you clean up,

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.740
your mother forgives you!

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:38.070
Sensei, you don't
have any room to speak.

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:40.410
Aw, look how much you've
messed it up in here again...

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:44.160
That's right! Shimura-san does the
cleaning around the house, doesn't she?

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:47.750
Which is why I told you I don't know.

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:50.090
The battle goes on for days on end!

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:51.590
"6th Year 3rd Class Boys Entrance"

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:51.750
Today we're having spaghetti, huh?

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:55.090
I did it! I got the meat sauce!

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:58.090
Which means the girls get
only noodles! That's too bad!

00:17:58.090 --> 00:18:00.430
I thought this might happen, so ta-da!

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:01.760
Tarako sprinkles!

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.770
We're going to have Tarako spaghetti!

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:06.440
That was sneaky, you girls!

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:10.110
Spaghetti sure is salty
with just the meat sauce, huh?

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:10.770
Mm-hmm.

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:12.440
What's wrong, Aya-chan?

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:15.530
To think we'd have to
sneak around like this.

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:17.110
How long is this going to go on?

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:19.820
I've had enough of this, myself.

00:18:19.820 --> 00:18:22.780
After all, I liked cleaning
and doing laundry from the start...

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:24.790
...and you,
more than anything, Aya-chan...

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.120
Tsuyoshi-kun...

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.120
"The final battle"

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:29.120
Ba-bing, ba-bing, get going already!

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:32.040
Principal, look at that! There seems
to be an air of seriousness down there!

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.050
Are they fighting?

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:34.050
I'll go look into it.

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:35.380
Why don't you?

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.050
Stop the violence!

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.050
Would you please admit defeat already!?

00:18:39.050 --> 00:18:40.050
--Yeah! Yeah!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:42.050
Why don't you end
this futile resistance!?

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.060
--Yeah! Yeah!

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:43.890
What is this?

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:45.390
It's not just inside the classroom,
but out on the school grounds as well?

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.390
Look out, Andoh-sensei!

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:48.190
There's a ditch there!

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:51.060
Are you okay, Andoh-sensei?

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:54.730
How could you miss a ditch this huge?

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:58.650
Ah! I forgot! They're coming today!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:02.070
Hello, Sana-chan's school!

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:07.080
The "Child's Toy"
ambush reportuh team is here!

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:08.750
Zenjiro!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.750
Special makeup!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.420
Zenjiro-san!

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:15.420
--Sana-chan!
--It's dangerous there!

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:17.420
What?

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:19.090
What's with this ditch!?

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:20.760
Oh, that's the gulf between
the boys and the girls.

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:23.430
A gulf between boys and goils?
Are you all fighting or something?

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.430
Well, you see...

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:28.770
Sana-chan, you mean the teachuhs at
your school aren't hot for each othuh,

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:30.440
and the boys and goils here
don't awl get along well?

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:31.770
It's like this...

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.060
What? What's it like?

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:35.360
What I mean is,
pretend I never said that, okay?

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:37.030
What are you talking about, Sana-chan?

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:38.530
Change of plans!

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:40.400
We're going to have a compelling
broadcast of the final conflict...

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.410
...between the woild's most
contentious boys and goils!

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:43.530
"So, what are you going to do?"

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:46.740
A limbo dance tournament! Let's li-!

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:53.880
"Child's Toy #33: World's most
contentious girls vs. boys-
knocking game of love"

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:49.250
"Child's Toy #33:

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.710
World's most contentious girls vs. boys-

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:54.380
knocking game of fury"

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:57.420
In this game, everyone takes shots at
each other, and whoever fawls off loses.

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:59.420
Whichevuh side loses has
to openly admit their loss,

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:02.090
and follow the othuh side. Got it?

00:20:02.090 --> 00:20:04.300
Okay, begin!

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:08.430
I got him! The girls win one!

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:10.060
Fall down already, Hayama!

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:11.440
I hate losing.

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:13.730
Okay then, Burutcha!

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.560
Burutcha counter.

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:19.940
You brought it on yourself.

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:24.780
Okay! The score at this point
is a tie, with boys 8, goils 8!

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:26.580
When it comes to limbo dancing,

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:28.450
even point-one millimeters
is okay with me!

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:30.080
--So, who do we have remaining?
--Oh, you're embarrassed!

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.040
Oh, it's Tsuyoshi-kun,
who sent us the postcard,

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.040
along with the ones who are
said to be the woild's woist couple,

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.380
Tanaka-sensei and Mitsuya-sensei,
as well as?

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:37.710
Sugita Aya-chan.

00:20:37.710 --> 00:20:38.710
Right!

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:40.050
Go, Tsuyoshi!

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:41.380
Show them the power of boys!

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:42.720
Aya-chan, fight!

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:44.760
Get him as hard as you can!

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:49.390
Aya-chan, we'll be
together forever, right?

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:51.890
Yes. Wherever we go...

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:56.730
--...we'll be together!
--...we'll be together!

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:57.730
Aya-chan!

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:00.070
Tsuyoshi-kun!

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:03.740
Wow... they showed us
some great drama, huh?

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:05.410
Enough of that!

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.200
At this point, it comes down
to the final confrontation,

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:10.740
between Tanaka and Mitsuya,
the two teachuhs!

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:12.750
Traditional hairstyle!

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:15.750
Wedding dress!

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:17.080
Incredible force!

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:18.080
It's scary!

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:21.760
This is for real. This is
what you call a real fight.

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:25.010
I... I love you...
I'm in love with you...

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:26.760
so I want you to look your best!

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:32.220
I love you, too! That's why I want you
to look even better by wearing a tuxedo!

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:34.430
Really?

00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:35.770
Is that right?

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:37.100
Hey, now...

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:40.900
Uh, in that case, why don't you
both change outfits at the reception?

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:43.110
He's right...

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:44.440
Yes, he is.

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:46.450
--We could always do that.
--We could always do that.

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:48.370
Well...

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:53.120
Goodness me...

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:55.120
I love you, Mitsuya-sensei.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:58.120
I love you, Tanaka-sensei.

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:00.130
--I love you.
--I love you.
--Uh, excuse me,

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:01.920
but what about the contest?

00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:03.420
--Mitsuya!
--and Tanaka...

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:04.920
--...declare the recommencement

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.420
--of their state of love-love!

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:09.760
Girls, I am not going to throw away
the five-story pagoda!

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:11.760
Was this about the five-story pagoda!?

00:22:11.760 --> 00:22:14.100
Boys, getting along is
the most important thing!

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:15.770
After coming this far, that's it!?

00:22:15.770 --> 00:22:19.770
--Enough of this, you guys!
This won't make for a good show!
--Zenjiro-chan!

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:24.780
Hey! What about the issue
between the boys and the girls!?

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:26.780
It doesn't matter.

00:22:26.780 --> 00:22:29.160
Hayama didn't appear
very much this time around.

00:22:29.160 --> 00:22:30.780
Our apologies to all his fans.

00:22:30.780 --> 00:22:33.450
Why did we have to
go through all of this?

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:35.450
To deepen our love.

00:22:35.450 --> 00:22:40.460
Fighting is useless,
and all for nothing!

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:42.250
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:47.760
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:52.510
In dire straits,

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:56.100
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.980
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.280
...panic!!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:19.120
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.830
he's there.

00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:25.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.220
...for two.

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.680
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:38.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:41.980
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.190 --> 00:23:46.690
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.950
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.750
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.250
...for two.

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:09.340
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.340 --> 00:24:12.680
The 6th grade TV personalities at the
height of popularity, Tobita Mayu-chan,

00:24:12.680 --> 00:24:17.680
Ayanohanamarukoji Tomomi-chan, and myself,
Kurata Sana, have formed an idol trio!

00:24:18.010 --> 00:24:22.350
We're a group of three 6th-grade girls,
so our name is "Shorokutai."

00:24:22.350 --> 00:24:23.690
Oh, you can't wait, can you?

00:24:23.690 --> 00:24:27.360
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 34; The Song, Dance, and Guest saga,

00:24:27.360 --> 00:24:31.030
A Singing Heart Goes 3,2,1

00:24:31.030 --> 00:24:35.410
"Shorokutai"? What kind of naming
is that? That's just nonsense.
